{
  "name": "IMPCDMX WF1 — Event Router (JMF / Fiery IQ / PrintOS / Frigate)",
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "imprenta/events/jmf",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook JMF (Jeti/Asanti)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -200
      ],
      "webhookId": "impcdmx-jmf"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "imprenta/events/fiery",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook Fiery IQ (VUTEk)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "impcdmx-fiery"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "imprenta/events/printos",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Webhook PrintOS (Indigo)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "impcdmx-printos"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "imprenta/events/frigate",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Webhook Frigate (CCTV)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "webhookId": "impcdmx-frigate"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normaliza eventos de las 4 fuentes a un formato común\nconst item = $input.first().json;\nconst body = item.body || {};\nconst path = (item.webhookUrl || '').split('/').pop() || '';\n\nconst sourceMap = { jmf: 'jmf', fiery: 'fiery_iq', printos: 'printos', frigate: 'frigate' };\nconst source = sourceMap[path] || 'manual';\n\n// machine_code: explícito en payload, o por defecto según la fuente\nconst defaultMachine = { jmf: 'jeti-mira', fiery_iq: 'vutek-gs3', printos: 'indigo-5500', frigate: 'acabado' };\nconst machine_code = body.machine_code || defaultMachine[source];\n\n// event_type: normalizar nombres comunes (JMF: Status/Resource; Frigate: review/detección)\nlet event_type = body.event_type || body.type || body.Status || 'unknown';\nevent_type = String(event_type).toLowerCase().replace(/\\s+/g, '_');\n\n// severity heurística: errores/paros se marcan major para que el clasificador IA decida\nlet severity = body.severity || null;\nif (!severity) {\n  if (/error|fail|fault|jam|stop/.test(event_type)) severity = 'major';\n  else if (/pause|warn/.test(event_type)) severity = 'minor';\n  else severity = 'info';\n}\n\n// base del webhook para invocar otros flujos del mismo n8n\nconst base_url = (item.webhookUrl || '').replace(/\\/imprenta\\/events\\/.*$/, '');\n\nreturn [{ json: { machine_code, source, event_type, severity, payload: body, base_url } }];"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Normalize Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "machines",
        "limit": 1,
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "code",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.machine_code }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Get Machine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "afViDlP7RXmh3xeK",
          "name": "IMPCDMX Supabase (imprenta-cdmx)"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const ev = $('Normalize Event').first().json;\nconst machine = $input.first().json || {};\nreturn [{ json: {\n  machine_id: machine.id || null,\n  source: ev.source,\n  event_type: ev.event_type,\n  severity: ev.severity,\n  payload: ev.payload,\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Build Event Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "tableId": "machine_events",
        "dataToSend": "autoMapInputData"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Insert machine_event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "afViDlP7RXmh3xeK",
          "name": "IMPCDMX Supabase (imprenta-cdmx)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.severity }}",
              "rightValue": "major|critical",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "¿Severidad alta?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Normalize Event').first().json.base_url }}/imprenta/andon",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ machine_code: $('Normalize Event').first().json.machine_code, source: $('Normalize Event').first().json.source, description: 'Evento automático: ' + $('Normalize Event').first().json.event_type, payload: $('Normalize Event').first().json.payload }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Disparar Andon (WF3)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Router de eventos — Imprenta CDMX\nRecibe eventos de las 4 fuentes, los normaliza, los guarda en Supabase (`machine_events`) y dispara el flujo Andon (WF3) cuando la severidad es major/critical.\n\n**Endpoints (POST):**\n- `/webhook/imprenta/events/jmf` — Agfa Jeti vía Asanti (JDF/JMF→HTTP)\n- `/webhook/imprenta/events/fiery` — Fiery IQ / agente en PC de control VUTEk\n- `/webhook/imprenta/events/printos` — HP PrintOS (si Indigo 5500 resulta compatible)\n- `/webhook/imprenta/events/frigate` — Frigate (eventos MQTT→HTTP o api/events)\n\nPayload mínimo: `{ \"machine_code\": \"...\", \"event_type\": \"...\", \"severity\": \"info|minor|major|critical\" }` — todos opcionales, hay defaults por fuente.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -100,
        -560
      ]
    }
